# FCE Reading Part 6 — gapped text (split + Your answers)

For **FCE / Mastering B2 Reading Part 6** (six gaps, seven sentences A–G, one extra):

## Hard UX (Honesty / Oceans etalon)

1. **Split pane:** article **left**, options + answers **right** (resizable on desktop).
2. **Left:** light passage box, optional blue **banner** title, two-column text; gaps = **numbered chips only** (`1`…`6` in small squares) — **no `<select>` in the passage**.
3. **Right:** full **A–G** sentence list, then **Your answers** with one **`<select>` per gap** (`— choose —` placeholder).
4. **Check** colours gap chips + dropdown borders; optional cohesion explanations via `explainCorrect` / `wrongNote` in the data pack.

## Shared engine (mandatory)

| Role | Path |
|------|------|
| Engine | `js/fce-reading-part6-gapped.js` → **`FCE_READING_PART6.mount`** |
| Styles | `css/fce-reading-part6-gapped.css` |
| Data | `window.FCE_R6_PACK` in `js/unit*-reading-*-data.js` — body uses `{{1}}`…`{{6}}` placeholders |
| Etalon page | `unit10-reading-honesty-is-the-best-policy/index.html` (layout reference) |

**Live pages using this engine:** `unit2-reading/joys-of-capoeira/`, `unit7-reading-black-friday/`.

## Don't

- Inline `<select>` gaps inside the article (old single-column layout).
- SHM / drag chips / third “bank” column for Part 6 gapped text.
- One-off custom HTML+JS per unit when `FCE_R6_PACK` + `mount` suffices.
- **Two mega-`<p>` bodies** — splits columns mid-sentence with empty space below (Capoeira bug).
- Listening Part 3 patterns (`.fce-p3-opt` bank **above** a single-column article) for Part 6.

## New Part 6 task rollout

1. Copy `unit2-reading/joys-of-capoeira/index.html` shell.
2. Add `js/unitN-reading-*-data.js` with `title`, `options`, `body` (`{{n}}`), `key`.
3. **`body` must be several `<p>` blocks** (≈ one per gap), like Honesty — **never** two giant paragraphs; `column-count: 2` + `break-inside: avoid` breaks layout with long `<p>`.
4. **Do not** use `column-fill: auto` or forced `min-height` on `.fce-r6-columns` — match Honesty (`column-count: 2` + `column-gap: 28px` only). Page width: **`fce-r6-page`** → `1180px` like Honesty.
5. Wire `FCE_READING_PART6.mount({ rootId: "fce-r6-root" })`.
6. Optional: `deck`, `explainCorrect`, `wrongNote`, `extraExplain` for rich check feedback (Honesty style).

